## Target
The `E2E-001` entry of the `scenarios_yaml` document (the scenario
registry, `documents.scenarios_yaml` → `docs/scenarios.yaml`).

Edit only that entry's `merged_steps:` block. Do not touch
`description:`, `service:`, `path:` or `user_stories:`, do not touch the
